    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36041" root="قفز" body-key="q">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَفَزَى</span></b>  <i>A leaping, jumping, springing,</i> or <i>bounding.</i> (K.) You say, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَآءَتِ الخَيْلُ تَعْدُو القَفَزَى</span>
[<i>The horses came running with a leaping, jumping, springing,</i> or <i>bounding, motion</i>]; from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">القَفْزُ</span>
[inf. n. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَفَزَ</span>]. (S, TA.)

